- Rong, Z., & {{<strong>Zuo, R.</strong><sup>*</sup>}}. Stability of equidistant-step Euler-type methods for time-changed stochastic differential equations. /Stat. Probab. Lett./, to appear, 2026.

- Wu, R., & {{<strong>Zuo, R.</strong><sup>*</sup>}}. A Milstein-type method for highly non-linear non-autonomous time-changed stochastic differential equations. /Appl. Numer. Math./, Vol. 230, 209-226, 2026. \[[https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apnum.2026.07.013 paper]\]

- *Zuo, R.*. Parameter-related strong convergence rates of Euler-type methods for time-changed stochastic differential equations. /Numer. Algorithms/, published online, 2026. \[[https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11075-026-02454-0 paper]\]

- Liu, W., Wang, M., & {{<strong>Zuo, R.</strong><sup>*</sup>}}. Parameter-related strong convergence rate of the backward Euler–Maruyama method for time-changed stochastic differential equations. /Fluct. Noise Lett./, Vol. 24, No. 03, 2550036, 2025. \[[https://www.worldscientific.com/doi/10.1142/S0219477525500361 paper]\] \[[https://github.com/zuoruchun/TCCIR code]\]


